      "title": "Incorrect trigger condition in LaunchToken::_decreaseFeeShares() causes permanent DoS of GTELaunchpadV2Pair functions",
      "uid": "SyZM6dWoy4F",
      "updatedAt": "2025-09-25T17:58:42.466Z",
